# The build context is "COPY . ." from the repository root, so
# anything here is sent to the daemon. The submodule alone is ~110k
# lines of C that the build never reads: the generators run from
# "make generate" on a developer's machine and their output is
# committed, so a container build needs none of it.
#
# Nothing here reaches the final image either way -- that is
# distroless and receives only the two Go binaries -- so this is
# about the size of the context, not about what ships.
fuzzball/

# Build and test artefacts.
build/
fbemerald
fbeconfig
*.test
coverage.out

# Local certificates and scratch state.
certs/
.git/
.github/

# The vendored dumps are importer fixtures, not container content.
testdata/
